Spoiler to save your buns in the preceding scenario follows...

When you are surrounded by identical creatures and you are concerned that
you might make a mistake as to their identities, the solution is to name
them.  That way you will know it was the pit fiend named Matilda that
grabbed you, and not Gertrude or Ima-Gene.  Now before you make your next
move, just do a '/' to identify your girls until you know which one is
Matilda.  She is the one you want to dis-embowel  ;^).

